Testing TLS server inside Enclave.
The client side uses ../test/tlsra_client running on the outside of enclave.

1) make
2) make oreore
   creating ./CA/my_ca.key, ./CA/my_ca.crt, ./CA/my_ca.srl, and hashed-files
   creating ./server.key, ./server.crt, and ./server.csr
3.1) make run-tlsra_server
3.2) cd ../test/; make; make run-tlsra_client
  
For Enclave signing
$ openssl genrsa -3 -out Enclave/enclave_private.pem 3072
$ openssl rsa -in Enclave/enclave_private.pem -pubout -out Enclave/enclave_public.pem
